WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.830
Let's make sure the room is well-lit, and sit away from the TV!

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:36.250
Darling...

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.130
Wait...

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.960
Darling...

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.850
Go for it! Two People in One Futon?!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.060
Darling...

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.010
Kiss me...

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.860
Aaa! Hey?!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.530
Huh?

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.720
What are you doing in my futon?!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.120
Hmm...?

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.290
It's true!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.750
Our first time in a futon!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.670
Stop calling everything a "first"!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:24.600
Ooh, Darling, its still so early~

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.520
You stay in there! If we sleep together,
I'll wind up stinking like a girl!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.110
What do you mean, you'll stink like a girl?

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:35.770
I mean that funny smell of yours!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.420
"Funny smell"?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.690
It's a nice smell!!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.760
<i>I</i>  call it "stinking like a girl."

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:44.920
So you don't like it?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.470
Hell no! I'm all about the <i>manly</i>  scent!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.210
I see...

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.750
You want to smell like a man?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.320
Yeah! If I do, maybe Darling will let me sleep with him!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.000
"Sleep with him"...?!

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.470
But why would he like girls
that smell like guys?

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.610
Ugh... Can't breathe...

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.850
I can't take it anymore!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:45.630
But at least now I smell like a man!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:49.010
Wait for me, Darling!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.390
Just you wait, Rizel...

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.450
I'm home.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.830
Welcome home, Darling!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.270
W-W-What is this stench?!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.640
Don't I have a manly scent now?

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.300
You stink like an old man!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.810
This wasn't it?

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.210
A manly scent...?

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:28.280
There's this guy I know from my high school days...

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.770
Papa A-san?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.890
Ah, the memories...

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:46.070
That's right, I am Oto Kokusai.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.150
Darling!

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.950
Hold your horses, I'll be right out.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.010
I'm Oto Kokusai.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.720
Huh? Am I doing it wrong?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.630
How to smell like a man?

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:20.490
Yeah!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.020
Darling!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.410
How's this?

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.280
The heck is that?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.060
This isn't right, either?

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:46.500
You still have options, Rizel!

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.850
Darling!

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.720
Go for it, youth!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.740
Let's go, Darling!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.510
Let's begin!

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:07.230
Ah, Darling!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.690
Catch! There's still more to try!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.900
If I can just finish this... If I can just...

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.540
Darling!

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.500
Head! Torso! Forearm! Thrust!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.620
I am a man!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.660
What you are is weird.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.140
This leaves us no choice.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.690
Let's go, Papa C!

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.860
Please teach me, Coach!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.160
Switch... on!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.380
I mustn't lose!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.870
Please...!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.290
Hey, Papa C...

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.590
Is this really going to work?

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.790
What are you saying, Coach?

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:15.330
Ace! I must aim for the ace!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.470
Are you listening, Coach?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.030
That's strange...

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:23.800
Aaah, Coach! I mean, Rizel!!

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.790
Aaah! Ow! That hurts!! More, more!!

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.690
What are those two up to?
Aaah! Ow! That hurts!! More, more!!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.810
Aaah! Ow! That hurts!! More, more!!

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:29.650
Rizel

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.980
Manly-Scent Project
Rizel

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:33.280
Proposal
Manly-Scent Project
Rizel

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.240
The Rizel Manly-Scent
Project Proposal document.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:41.810
It is among the most hard-fought and satisfying works of my lifetime.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.020
Hurry, come to me, Rizel!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.160
She's here!

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.520
Hey, Papa...

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.860
Hmm? What is it, Rizel?

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:51.840
I think I've had enough of this...

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.570
Hey, Rizel!

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:57.650
Good night...

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:01.770
Rizel, didn't you come to me to find out
how to smell like a man?!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.680
Hey!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.020
It can't be...

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.850
My proposal document...

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:31.730
Tomonori! Your laundry's been piling up.
Bring out what you've got in there.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.060
Okay!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:35.630
Here.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.870
Leave it in that basket.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.680
Tomonori...

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:43.600
I don't know what you said to her,
but you shouldn't be so hard on Rizel-chan.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.800
I didn't say anything.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.180
Well, all right then...

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.950
Ta-da! Catbee's <i>Man's Aroma</i> shampoo,
extra-large bottle!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.250
I <i>can't</i>  go wrong with this, can I?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.900
Wait for me, Darling!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.410
Wait till he gets a load of this.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.350
I've gotten the manly scent down perfectly!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.650
He's here!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.690
Huh? I'm floating!

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:38.090
What's wrong, Darling?
I don't stink like a girl anymore!

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:42.110
You're a girl, and that's enough to make you stink like a girl!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.840
No...

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.580
This isn't working...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.010
Mother, are these...?

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.850
Quite a sight, aren't they?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:17.320
Tomonori won't wear anything but these, so I bought quite a few of them.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.810
Kind of like Q-chan, eh?

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:19.720
Q-chan?

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.780
A character that used to be popular.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:26.490
But anyway, does Darling really like these that much?

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.880
Well, he just suddenly started wearing them
this past school year.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:33.950
He doesn't even play rugby,
but he says they're "manly" or something.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.170
"Manly"?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.340
Mother, can I borrow one of these?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.390
Sure, but...

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.090
Yes!!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.810
Darling, do you mind if I come in?

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.840
Wouldn't matter if I did...

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:54.310
Try... Attack!!!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:58.140
If I wear this, I won't stink like a girl, right?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:00.460
What the hell are you thinking?!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:04.190
Look here! A girl stinks like a girl no matter what!

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:08.870
Ehhh?! Then what should I do, Darling?

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.430
Please, tell me... what should I do?

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:16.180
C-C-Cut it out!! What's gotten into you
these past few days?

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:17.270
Because...

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.020
That's not an answer!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.880
Because, because... I don't know what I'm supposed to do!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.170
Just act normally, you idiot!

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.840
No way...

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.210
But I tried so hard, and got so far...

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.360
Papas... A! B! C!

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:15.860
No, no matter what you ask,
we cannot answer.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.800
It's a matter of national secrecy.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.730
Being Rizel's Papas means everything to us!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:23.790
Rizel!!!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:29.730
Papas... A! B! C!

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:33.510
No, no matter what you ask, we cannot answer.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.400
It's a matter of national secrecy.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:39.280
Right now, being Rizel's Papas means everything to us!

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:42.650
Yes, we want to grant our precious Rizel's
each and every wish.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.990
We want to see Rizel's happy, smiling face.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:47.330
For Rizel, we would even ******!!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:50.430
At any rate, everything we do is for Rizel!

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.250
Rizel!!!
